as item 4 in the Anti-Basic Wall build for Belerick.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/belerick#build-anti-basic-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 5 in the Anti-Basic Wall build for Belerick.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/belerick#build-anti-basic-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Guardian Helmet\",\"text\":\"Purchase Guardian Helmet (2,500 gold) as item 6 in the Anti-Basic Wall build for Belerick.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/belerick#build-anti-basic-wall\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/belerick\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-07T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":70,\"name\":\"Belerick\",\"slug\":\"belerick\",\"title\":\"Guard of Nature\",\"role\":[\"Tank\"],\"specialty\":[\"Crowd Control\",\"Regen\"],\"lane\":[\"Roam\"],\"tier\":\"A\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2018,\"stats\":{\"durability\":90,\"offense\":40,\"controlEffect\":100,\"difficulty\":10},\"winRate\":52.13,\"pickRate\":1.74,\"banRate\":55.89,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"lancelot\",\"heroName\":\"Lancelot\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Belerick excels at controlling enemies at close range, making him a great counter against squishy Assassins who need to get close to deal damage, like Lancelot and Ling.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"ling\",\"heroName\":\"Ling\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Belerick excels at controlling enemies at close range, making him a great counter against squishy Assassins who need to get close to deal damage, like Lancelot and Ling.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"valir\",\"heroName\":\"Valir\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Belerick is countered by heroes with long-range attacks like Valir and Xavier.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"xavier\",\"heroName\":\"Xavier\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Belerick is countered by heroes with long-range attacks like Valir and Xavier.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_64900b3344e166f05645ac5759207897.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5f2a9eca0bafd4ed8dc39a93c771b3af.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"14\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_549ab8159821398b48e7e79ceb298396.png\",\"tip\":\"DPS heroes with recovery ability are the perfect matches with Belerick, since they add to Belerick's durability, so he can deal more damage.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"1\",\"heroName\":\"Miya\",\"heroSlug\":\"miya\",\"icon\":\"https://indoch.s3.ml.moonlian.com/web/madmin/image_a844f9aa51baefa6878801edd85fec5e.png\",\"tip\":\"Belerick is a squishy killer. Do not retreat when using Belerick and just rush to the enemy suqishy heroes face.If those heroes run away, then you're half way to victory.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"56\",\"heroName\":\"Gusion\",\"heroSlug\":\"gusion\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/0226b7cc6015fb50aa8ff4e1c9cf8c62.png?w=150-150-242539\",\"tip\":\"Belerick is vulnerable against the heroes that could deal a high amount of damage. His passive won't help that much when facing these kinds of heroes, for he won't have the time to convert his passive into damage.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Deadly Thorns\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Whenever Belerick takes 50 or more damage, he has a 25% chance to shoot the nearest enemy unit, dealing 55 (+5*Hero Level) (+ 1.8% of his Max HP) Magic Damage (scales with level). This attack can be triggered once every 0.4s.\\n\\nHis HP obtained from equipment and emblems is increased by 30%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whenever Belerick takes 50 or more damage, he has a 25% chance to shoot the nearest enemy unit, dealing 55 (+5*Hero Level) (+ 1.8% of his Max HP) Magic Damage (scales with level). This attack can be triggered once every 0.4s.\\n\\nHis HP obtained from equipment and emblems is increased by 30%.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_570abe4ad1267c65f2c4f368a5f4add9.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Ancient Seed\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Belerick releases vines in a designated direction, dealing 200 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies along the path and slowing them by 25%. Ancient Seeds left by the vines will erupt into thorns after 0.8s, dealing 200 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies on the path and taunting them for 1.2s.\\n\\nDeals 80% extra damage against Minions.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Belerick releases vines in a designated direction, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies along the path and slowing them by 25%. Ancient Seeds left by the vines will erupt into thorns after 0.8s, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies on the path and taunting them for 1.2s.\\n\\nDeals 80% extra damage against Minions.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"8s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5433e8607e73b325e705ad88ca513c98.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Nature's Strike\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Belerick gains 80% Movement Speed (decays over 2s) and enhances his next Basic Attack.\\n\\nThe enhanced Basic Attack deals 300 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slows the target by 60% for 1.4s. Belerick also recovers HP equal to 240 + 10% of his lost HP.\\n\\nEach time Deadly Thorns is triggered, this skill's cooldown is reduced by 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Belerick gains 80% Movement Speed (decays over 2s) and enhances his next Basic Attack.\\n\\nThe enhanced Basic Attack deals 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and slows the target by 60% for 1.4s. Belerick also recovers HP equal to 240 + 10% of his lost HP.\\n\\nEach time \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Deadly Thorns\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is triggered, this skill's cooldown is reduced by 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"14s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bd8021db8bc655e12a9de54aef597fb3.png\",\"tags\":[\"Speed Up\",\"Heal\"]},{\"name\":\"Wrath of Dryad\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Belerick conjures spreading vines around him, dealing 100 (+30% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in the area 4 times, taunting and slowing them for 1.5s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Belerick conjures spreading vines around him, dealing 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+30% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies in the area 4 times, taunting and slowing them for 1.5s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"50s\",\"manaCost\":\"150\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8b1501526a70c36f4c89d7ab971f9eb0.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"AOE\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Main the 2nd skill. Upgrage the Ultimate when possible. Then the 1st skill.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Main the 2nd skill. Upgrage the Ultimate when possible. Then the 1st skill.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"natan\",\"heroName\":\"Natan\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Belerick works well with heroes who can dish out a lot of damage against enemies CC'd by his taunt, such as Miya and Natan.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"miya\",\"heroName\":\"Miya\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Belerick works well with heroes who can dish out a lot of damage against enemies CC'd by his taunt, such as Miya and Natan.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, use Belerick's 2nd Skill to close the distance with the opponent and slow them with his enhanced Basic Attack, then follow up with his 1st Skill to CC them.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":7020,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bd8021db8bc655e12a9de54aef597fb3.png\"},{\"skillId\":7000,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":7010,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5433e8607e73b325e705ad88ca513c98.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, charge into the enemy formation with Belerick's 2nd Skill and taunt as many targets as possible with his Ultimate, then follow up with his 1st Skill to keep them taunted.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":7020,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bd8021db8bc655e12a9de54aef597fb3.png\"},{\"skillId\":7030,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8b1501526a70c36f4c89d7ab971f9eb0.png\"},{\"skillId\":7010,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5433e8607e73b325e705ad88ca513c98.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Belerick build, counter, and roam guide for Mobile Legends. Learn when to draft him, punish marksmen, flex tank items, and avoid trap matchups in MLBB.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Belerick is a punishment tank, not a universal frontliner. Pick him when the enemy damage plan must hit your body many times before it reaches your carries. If the lobby is built around long-range poke, true damage, or instant backline dives, he becomes a slow tree walking into the wrong storm.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"belerick\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-07\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"roam-punishment\",\"name\":\"Roam Punishment\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"cursed-helmet\",\"name\":\"Cursed Helmet\",\"cost\":1910,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"guardian-helmet\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\",\"cost\":2500,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"cursed-helmet\",\"name\":\"Cursed Helmet\"},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"tank\",\"name\":\"Tank Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"vitality\",\"name\":\"Vitality\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/vitality.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"tenacity\",\"name\":\"Tenacity\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/tenacity.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"vengeance\",\"name\":\"Vengeance\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"encourage\",\"name\":\"Encourage\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the first threat is single-rotation magic burst before your sustain loop starts.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use into repeated magic ticks or poke that keeps tagging you before the engage.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default roam setup for punishing attack-speed carries that keep hitting your frontline.\",\"totalCost\":11100,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":4650,\"sources\":[\"Cursed Helmet\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\",\"Guardian Helmet\"]},{\"key\":\"hpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hpRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Guardian Helmet\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":75,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":98,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Cursed Helmet\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=belerick\u0026items=tough-boots%2Ccursed-helmet%2Cdominance-ice%2Coracle%2Cimmortality%2Cguardian-helmet\u0026blessing=encou