",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Special\",\"tagSlug\":\"special\",\"price\":\"188\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero704-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/belerick/Hero704-portrait-20220525165734.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Belerick/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Thundering Fortress\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Starlight\",\"tagSlug\":\"starlight\",\"price\":\"2026/07 StarLight Reward\",\"portraitFile\":null,\"portraitUrl\":null,\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Belerick/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Sundering Fortress\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Starlight\",\"tagSlug\":\"starlight\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":null,\"portraitUrl\":null,\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/belerick/Belerick-Sundering-Fortress-20260617005117.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Belerick/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Belerick is the Ancient Guard, a sentient tree of immense age and power who has watched over the natural world since the dawn of creation. His bark is harder than any forged armor, and his roots stretch deep into the earth, drawing on the planet's own life force to sustain him. When attacked, Belerick retaliates automatically, his thorns and vines lashing out at any who dare strike the ancient guardian. The corruption of the Abyss began poisoning the world-tree network that connects all forests, rousing Belerick from his millennia-long vigil. He now walks the Land of Dawn, his towering form a living fortress protecting allies and punishing those who would defile the natural order.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"hylos\",\"heroName\":\"Hylos\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow ancient nature guardian and protector of the wilds\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"relat